**候签定理 4.125(A378640 的值域 = A076245 去首项)**〔open;原文(A378640 评注,同上):"Up to n = 10^7 the distinct terms of the sequence (which are also the record values) are {3, 5, 7, 11, 15, 17, 19, 23, 29, 47, 51, 53}. Is this A076245 (for n >= 2)?";A076245 = A051547(t)=lcm(φ(1),…,φ(t)) 的记录位置;落 `D5/S3/Factorization/TotientLcmRecordRange`;拟议逃逸见证:令 L(t)=lcm(φ(1),…,φ(t)),L(0)=1;对 m≥2:∃N≥1, a(N)=m ⟺ L(m−1) < L(m);(⇐)取 N=L(m−1):φ(j) ∣ N 对 j<m 而 φ(m) ∤ L(m−1)(否则 L(m)=L(m−1));(⇒)a(N)=m 给出 L(m−1) ∣ N 而 φ(m) ∤ N,故 φ(m) ∤ L(m−1)〕。对一切 m≥2:m 属于 A378640 的值域 ⟺ L(m−1) < L(m),即 A378640 的相异值恰为 A076245 去掉首项 1。

